// 09r: in the daily/weekly challenge spawns (s) and level-up offers (u) draw from their OWN seeded streams. Particles, sparks and
// other effects keep using Math.random, whose amount depends on the phone's frame rate – sharing one stream made every player's
// challenge different from the first enemy. Test tests/tools/dailysame.js.
// 09r: screen shake as "trauma" – run.shake (0–9, events raise it, it decays) is turned into trauma 0–1 and the offset is trauma² × max
